{"title":"Career roadmap — IT Support Executive","role":"IT Support Executive","summary":"An IT Support Executive keeps an organisation's computers, software, networks, user accounts, peripherals, and day-to-day IT services functioning reliably. The role is an excellent entry point into IT infrastructure, system administration, cloud, networking, cybersecurity, and IT operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"General BCA"},"about":[{"label":"Core principle","text":"Entry-level IT support hiring is driven heavily by hands-on troubleshooting ability, operating-system/network knowledge, communication, ticket handling, and practical labs rather than certificates alone."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What to build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"IT Support / Help Desk"},{"text":"Hardware, Windows/Linux, networking, troubleshooting, ticketing"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"System Administrator / IT Operations"},{"text":"Servers, Active Directory, cloud, automation, security"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior IT Engineer / Infrastructure Lead"},{"text":"Cloud infrastructure, security, architecture, team leadership"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"IT Operations Manager / Infrastructure Architect"},{"text":"Enterprise infrastructure, automation, resilience, governance"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — IT fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer hardware"},{"text":"CPU, RAM and storage"},{"text":"Motherboards and peripherals"},{"text":"BIOS/UEFI"},{"text":"Storage technologies"},{"text":"Printers and scanners"},{"text":"Hardware diagnostics"},{"text":"Device drivers"},{"text":"Basic hardware replacement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operating systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Windows"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Installation"},{"text":"User accounts"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Device Manager"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Event Viewer"},{"text":"Task Manager"},{"text":"Windows Update"},{"text":"Registry basics"},{"text":"Backup/recovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ubuntu"},{"text":"Filesystem"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Processes"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Package management"},{"text":"Shell basics"},{"text":"SSH"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Networking + support operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking is one of the most important skills for IT support."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OSI model"},{"text":"TCP/IP"},{"text":"IPv4/IPv6"},{"text":"Subnetting"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"NAT"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"TCP/UDP"},{"text":"Ethernet"},{"text":"Wi-Fi"},{"text":"Routers"},{"text":"Switches"},{"text":"Firewalls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Troubleshooting commands"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ping"},{"text":"ipconfig / ifconfig"},{"text":"tracert / traceroute"},{"text":"nslookup"},{"text":"netstat"},{"text":"arp"},{"text":"ssh"},{"text":"curl"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Support workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"User reports issue"},{"type":"flow","items":["Create ticket","Gather information","Diagnose","Resolve","Document","Close","Escalate if necessary"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Enterprise IT"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond basic desktop support."},{"type":"h","text":"Windows enterprise"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active Directory"},{"text":"Group Policy"},{"text":"Domain controllers"},{"text":"User/group management"},{"text":"Organizational Units"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"File shares"},{"text":"Windows Server"},{"text":"Remote De